  "decision": "Keep the pipeline WITHOUT JRC. The U-Net already separates permanent water (only 0.012 of 0.612 km2 of its new water falls on JRC >=50% water). JRC mainly removes debris deposited in the normal river channel, which EMS counts as damage, so masking it lowers recall and F1 at every threshold while damage and cut-off results are unchanged. It would also add an input outside the brief's core list."
